<blockquote class="uncited"><div>Hello to all,<br>I have installed the new Alpha on my RT3S. All work fine from the first moment. Congrations for this perfect job and many thanks in order to give the RT3S a new life!!! Perhaps a small whish regarding the key mapping to get compatibillity with the GD-77 / DM-1801: please change the functions of arrow keys and rotary switch. Use the rotary switch as horrizontal arrow keys. The vertical arrow keys should select the entries within a zone and the rotary switch the talkgroups in each entry (RX group List). That would be great.<br>73´s de DF1OG, Ingo</div></blockquote>Arrow keys already select the zone<br><br>Rotary control is used to change channel and change frequency, hence it can not be used to change talkgroup, hence the Up/Down arrow keys are use for this purpose.<br><br>If you are suggesting the rotary control should not be used to change channel or frequency, I think everyone else on the forum will dissagree with this form of UI.<br><br>We will not be changing the operation of the rotary control for channel / frequency control.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Mon Oct 31, 2022 9:43 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
