<blockquote class="uncited"><div>2) Is there a way to simultaneously monitor two channels "A and B" with Opengd77?<br><br>I'm doing several tests with the three radios in various scenarios, soon I'll be posting feedback.</div></blockquote><br>Quick menu&gt; Dual Watch<br>[/quote]<br><br>The radio only has one physical receiver. Although the VFO has a Dual Watch function, it is just switching quickly between frequencies<br><br>You can do the same thing by making a Zone with just 2 channels, and using Scan.<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=50">VK3KYY</a> — Tue Oct 25, 2022 10:32 pm</p><hr />
